s/jax-ml/jax/issues/events/27914789895"},{"actor":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28624715?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BalzaniEdoardo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BalzaniEdoardo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BalzaniEdoardo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BalzaniEdoardo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BalzaniEdoardo","id":28624715,"login":"BalzaniEdoardo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NjI0NzE1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BalzaniEdoardo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BalzaniEdoardo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BalzaniEdoardo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BalzaniEdoardo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BalzaniEdoardo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BalzaniEdoardo","user_view_type":"public"},"created_at":"2026-07-13T15:13:40Z","event":"cross-referenced","source":{"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"author_association":"COLLABORATOR","body":"## Summary\r\n\r\nThis is the second pr focusing on the efficiency of the convolution module. \r\n\r\nHere we introduce:\r\n\r\n- A fast path when the convolution is not batched, preventing scans and longer compilation time. `_unbatched_convolve` implements the equivalent of the scan based convolve path.\r\n- We used scipy optimal padding for fft convolved, implemented in `_fft_valid_conv`. The native `jax.scipy.fftconvolve` can be about 3x slower because it doesn't apply any padding.\r\n- Add missing static args in jitted functions, which prevents re-tracing at each call.\r\n\r\n## Notes\r\n\r\n~`_fft_overlap_save_convolve` is not jitted. Jitting it resulted in flaky test failures: the overlap-save did not match the regular full convolution. The reason is still unknown, but the errors were few but very large.~\r\n\r\nThe issue above regarding overlap-save has been identified: nested scan + padding resulted in garbage values instead of 0s under jit compilation. The issue was raised in jax [#39120](https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/39120). A workaround as been added which uses a where to enforce 0s at the padded location runtime. \r\n","closed_at":"2026-07-13T15:37:19Z","comments":1,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flatironinstitute/nemos/issues/589/comments","created_at":"2026-07-10T12:22:26Z","draft":false,"events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flatironinstitute/nemos/issues/589/events","html_url":"https://github.com/flatironinstitute/nemos/pull/589","id":4854932397,"issue_field_values":[],"labels":[],"labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flatironinstitute/nemos/issues/589/labels{/name}","locked":false,"milestone":null,"node_id":"PR_kwDOI5gZhs7wKZ7w","number":589,"performed_via_github_app":null,"pull_request":{"diff_url":"https://github.com/flatironinstitute/nemos/pull/589.diff","html_url":"https://github.com/flatironinstitute/nemos/pull/589","merged_at":"2026-07-13T15:37:19Z","patch_url":"https://github.com/flatironinstitute/nemos/pull/589.patch","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flatironinstitute/nemos/pulls/589"},"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flatironinstitute/nemos/issues/589/reactions"},"repository":{"allow_forking":true,"archive_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flatironinstitute/nemos/{archive_format}{/ref}","archived":false,"assignees_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flatironinstitute/nemos/assignees{/user}","blobs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flatironinstitute/nemos/git/blobs{/sha}","branches_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flatironinstitute/nemos/branches{/branch}","clone_url":"https://github.com/flatironinstitute/nemos.git","collaborators_url":"https:/